---
title: "Engine daily loop: one trading session t"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Eng as Engine
    participant Store as Chain store
    participant View as MarketView as_of t
    participant Fill as Fill model
    participant Exp as Expiry and assignment
    participant Mark as Marker
    participant Hedge as Hedger
    participant Risk as Risk and margin
    participant Sig as Signals
    participant Strat as Strategy
    participant Led as Ledger
    Eng->>Store: load snapshot t#58; option_quotes, quote_iv, smile_fits, S_t, r_t, dividends, VIX
    Store-->>Eng: snapshot t, or none on a missing session
    Eng->>View: create view with as_of = t and the run's split
    Note right of View: A read dated after t raises LookAheadError, and as_of past the split end raises SplitError
    Eng->>Exp: book early assignments and exercises decided at t-1
    Note right of Exp: Start of day#58; events decided at t-1
    Exp-->>Eng: share deliveries at strike K
    Eng->>Eng: cancel pending orders on lots these events removed (LOT_REMOVED)
    Eng->>Eng: dividends with ex-date t on share positions
    Eng->>Eng: cash interest from t-1 to t at r_cc of t-1
    Eng->>Fill: pending orders created at t-1
    alt snapshot t exists
        Fill->>View: quote for each leg
        Fill-->>Eng: fills at mid plus or minus k times half-spread in integer cents, fees
        Fill-->>Eng: cap from the order-date volume V_t (hard cap of record), remainder cancelled with reason
    else no snapshot on t
        Fill-->>Eng: orders wait for the next snapshot
    end
    Eng->>Exp: contracts expiring at t
    Exp->>View: SPY official close S_t
    Exp-->>Eng: ITM by at least 0.01 settles into shares at K, else expires, pin flags
    Eng->>Mark: mark every open lot
    Mark->>View: quote mid, zero-bid mid, surface IV or stale surface
    Mark-->>Eng: mark_price, mark_source, surface flags, Black-76 greeks per lot
    Eng->>Eng: NAV_mid and NAV_liq
    Eng->>Hedge: net delta including delivered shares
    alt schedule or band says hedge
        Hedge-->>Eng: SPY trade at S_t with commission and slippage
    else no hedge today
        Hedge-->>Eng: no trade
    end
    Eng->>Led: greeks_snapshots and P&L attribution against t-1
    Eng->>Risk: end-of-day greek budgets, stress grid cells, net margin requirement
    Risk-->>Eng: reduce-only orders for t+1 on breach or margin call
    Eng->>Sig: compute signals from the view, refitting on schedule
    Sig->>View: SPY bars, VIX and surface dated up to t
    Sig-->>Eng: IV30, RV forecast, VRP spread, regime, model_fit_date
    Eng->>Strat: view, signals, open positions
    Strat-->>Eng: exits and entries as order intents
    Eng->>Risk: pre-trade check of each intent#58; greeks, stress cells, net margin
    Risk-->>Eng: scaled, rejected or accepted orders queued for t+1
    Eng->>Exp: early-exercise test for t+1#58; calls by closed form before an ex-date, puts on the CRR lattice
    Exp-->>Eng: assignments and exercises effective at t+1
    Eng->>Led: orders, fills, position_marks, hedges, expiry_events, risk_events, signals, daily_pnl
    Led-->>Eng: rows appended for session t
